

Shiri sarrafa-ƙwaƙwalwa: 1.

>> x := 0.
>> y := ['Hello'].
>> q := { ['']. }.
>> p := Gaskiya.
>> a := Jeri ← 1 ; 2 ; 3 ; 4.
>> c := Abu sabo.
c idan: ['greet:'] yi: { Fitarwa rubuta: ['greet!']. }.

>> usedMemory1 := 0.
>> usedMemory2 := 0.
>> usedMemory3 := 0.
>> usedMemory4 := 0.
>> usedMemory5 := 0.

Shiri tsaftace.
>> usedMemory1 := (Shiri ƙwaƙwalwa ? 0).




